而且他知道那是潘画的。

1577
01:11:35.680 --> 01:11:41.340
And I just feel like this is just a little moment between the two of them, even though they're not together.
我觉得这只是他们俩之间的一个小瞬间，尽管他们当时还没在一起。

1578
01:11:42.800 --> 01:11:44.820
I just thought it was really sweet.
我只是觉得这真的好温馨。

1579
01:11:45.680 --> 01:11:54.620
Well, they've purposely not had much Jim-Pam interaction for the last three episodes, because, you know, next week is Beach Games.
嗯，为了迎接下周的海滩游戏，过去三集他们故意减少了吉姆和潘的互动。

1580
01:11:54.840 --> 01:11:55.240
Oh.
哦。

1581
01:11:55.420 --> 01:11:57.100
And we're going to have a big moment.
然后我们会迎来一个重大时刻。

1582
01:11:57.320 --> 01:11:58.120
Oh, are we?
哦，是吗？

1583
01:11:58.120 --> 01:11:59.940
And they really wanted that to be a surprise.
他们真的很希望那会是一个惊喜。

1584
01:12:00.840 --> 01:12:02.740
Man, I re-watched Beach Games.
天哪，我重温了海滩游戏那一集。

1585
01:12:02.740 --> 01:12:05.980
