我知道我们后面会聊到，但当时我就想，哇，潘！

1586
01:12:06.800 --> 01:12:07.200
Yeah.
对啊。

1587
01:12:07.420 --> 01:12:13.720
But even still, they did want some little moment where you were reminded of the affection of these two characters.
不过即便如此，他们还是想要一些小瞬间，让你能记起这两个角色之间的情意。

1588
01:12:13.720 --> 01:12:14.460
And this was it.
而这就是其中之一。

1589
01:12:14.580 --> 01:12:15.640
Just him seeing the poster.
就是他看到了那张海报。

1590
01:12:15.780 --> 01:12:16.560
That's all you got.
你也就得到了这么一点。

1591
01:12:16.880 --> 01:12:17.200
Yeah.
对。

1592
01:12:17.360 --> 01:12:17.920
In this episode.
在这集里。

1593
01:12:18.200 --> 01:12:20.220
And it inspired him for the tag.
这给了他关于片尾彩蛋的灵感。

1594
01:12:20.220 --> 01:12:21.320
And we'll get to that.
我们待会儿会聊到那点。

1595
01:12:21.820 --> 01:12:22.760
I think so, too.
我也这么觉得。

1596
01:12:23.040 --> 01:12:23.200
Yeah.
是的。

1597
01:12:23.300 --> 01:12:30.820
Well, something we haven't talked much about is the Andy Dwight storyline in this episode, where they're going around and they're hanging up these posters.
嗯，我们之前没怎么聊过的一点是这一集里安迪和德怀特的故事线，他们到处去贴这些海报。

1598
01:12:30.820 --> 01:12:35.000
And Dwight is just being so condescending to Andy the whole time.
而德怀特全程对安迪都傲慢无礼。

1599
01:12:35.640 --> 01:12:38.880
But it's very clear to Andy that this is a drawing of Dwight.
但安迪很清楚这画的是德怀特。

1600
01:12:39.040 --> 01:12:40.580
So he's going along with it.
所以他也就顺着配合了。

1601
01:12:40.780 --> 01:12:40.960
Yeah.
是啊。

1602
01:12:41.340 --> 01:12:45.160
And he takes extra flyers, says he's going to put them up all over the town.
而且他拿了额外的传单，说要在全镇到处贴。

1603
01:12:45.340 --> 01:12:47.480
And there is a great deleted scene, Jenna.
而且有一段很棒的被删减片段，珍娜。

1604
01:12:47.600 --> 01:12:48.520
It's a quick moment.
这是一个很短的镜头。

1605
01:12:48.520 --> 01:12:53.440
But as Michael and the ladies are driving back, they come to a red light.
但当迈克尔和女士们开车回去时，他们遇到了一个红灯。

1606
01:12:53.600 --> 01:12:57.920
And Michael looks out the window and sees one of the flyers on a tree.
迈克尔看着窗外，发现一棵树上贴着一张传单。

1607
