然后简道歉了。

1635
01:14:40.140 --> 01:14:42.220
She says, I don't like how that phone call went earlier.
她说，我不喜欢刚才那通电话的语气。

1636
01:14:42.840 --> 01:14:45.500
So I drove all the way here to say, I'm sorry.
所以我大老远开车过来，想说声对不起。

1637
01:14:45.780 --> 01:14:46.980
Can we get some dinner?
我们去吃晚饭好吗？

1638
01:14:47.380 --> 01:14:49.820
They awkwardly hold hands.
他们尴尬地手拉着手。

1639
01:14:50.280 --> 01:14:51.220
Such a weird moment.
真是个诡异的时刻。

1640
01:14:51.540 --> 01:14:51.740
So weird.
太诡异了。

1641
01:14:52.580 --> 01:14:55.300
Steve's performance in this scene is so brilliant.
史蒂夫在这个场景里的表演太精彩了。

1642
01:14:55.300 --> 01:15:00.980
When she starts listening to the message and he's kind of looking off, he has this expression
当她开始听留言时，他把视线移开，脸上露出了

1643
01:15:00.980 --> 01:15:02.240
on his face.
那种表情。

1644
01:15:02.640 --> 01:15:03.960
It's just brilliant.
简直绝了。

1645
01:15:03.960 --> 01:15:09.300
And he's just saying things like, maybe we could get Italian, Chinese.
而且他说着诸如“也许我们可以吃意大利菜、中餐”之类的话。

1646
01:15:10.760 --> 01:15:16.520
Jan hears the breakup message and she leaves without saying a word.
简听到了分手留言，一言不发地走了。

1647
01:15:16.860 --> 01:15:17.220
Yeah.
对。

1648
