But I went to the blogs of Jenny Tan and Kath.
不过我看了珍妮·陈和卡思的博客。

1649
01:15:22.680 --> 01:15:23.400
What'd they have?
她们说了什么？

1650
01:15:23.540 --> 01:15:28.360
Well, first of all, Kath said that when they started shooting the scene, Melora had on dark
嗯，首先，卡思说当他们开始拍这个场景时，梅洛拉穿着深色

1651
01:15:28.360 --> 01:15:34.720
colored nail polish and Greg stopped the scene because he didn't think that it fit her character
彩色指甲油，格雷格叫停了这场戏，因为他觉得这不符合她的角色设定

1652
01:15:34.720 --> 01:15:36.000
and he had them change it.
并让他们换掉了。

1653
01:15:36.260 --> 01:15:37.000
Oh, wow.
噢，哇塞。

1654
01:15:37.000 --> 01:15:41.980
And she noted how impressed she was at his attention to detail, that everything mattered.
她提到自己对他的细节关注度印象深刻，每一个细节都至关重要。

1655
01:15:42.340 --> 01:15:43.980
The smallest details mattered.
最微小的细节也很重要。

1656
01:15:44.180 --> 01:15:48.280
And I can imagine if that nail polish was distracting to Greg, it might be distracting
我能想象，如果那个指甲油对格雷格来说很让人分心，那对

1657
01:15:48.280 --> 01:15:51.000
to an audience member and it would take you out of the scene.
观众来说也可能会很分心，并且会让你出戏。

1658
01:15:51.160 --> 01:15:54.540
And being in this scene with these two characters was so important.
而且能和这两个角色一起演这场戏是如此重要。

1659
01:15:55.300 --> 01:15:55.540
Yeah.
是啊。

1660
01:15:56.320 --> 01:15:59.160
That would have been weird to me to see Jan with dark nail polish.
如果看到简涂着深色指甲油，我会觉得很怪异。

1661
01:15:59.300 --> 01:16:00.500
