我会被那吓一跳的。

1662
01:16:00.620 --> 01:16:03.200
Well, Jenny Tan said that while they were shooting this scene,
嗯，珍妮·谭说，在他们拍摄这场戏时，

1663
01:16:03.200 --> 01:16:09.240
they gave Melora and Steve the option of doing alternate endings and that in one,
他们给梅洛拉和史蒂夫提供了拍摄不同结局的选择，其中一个结局是

1664
01:16:09.680 --> 01:16:13.460
Melora threw something and in another one, she growled at him.
梅洛拉扔了东西，另一个结局是她向他发出低吼。

1665
01:16:14.060 --> 01:16:15.880
She just growled at the end.
最后她只是低吼了一声。

1666
01:16:16.440 --> 01:16:16.980
Growled?
低吼？

1667
01:16:17.120 --> 01:16:17.660
Growled.
低吼。

1668
01:16:18.040 --> 01:16:23.440
And then in another one, she broke down crying and they were watching the taping with Jean and
然后还有一个结局是她崩溃大哭，他们和编剧琼以及

1669
01:16:23.440 --> 01:16:28.840
Lee, the writers, and Jean and Lee asked them their opinion and that she and Kath said that
李一起观看了录像，琼和李征求了他们的意见，她和凯斯说

1670
01:16:28.840 --> 01:16:32.560
they both felt that Jan would be more mad than sad.
她们都觉得简比起难过，更多的是愤怒。

1671
01:16:33.200 --> 01:16:36.640
And they were so excited when they saw the final cut because they felt like they had a
当他们看到最终剪辑版时感到无比兴奋，因为他们觉得自己对

1672
01:16:36.640 --> 01:16:39.820
little part in picking the ending of the scene.
挑选这场戏的结局起到了微小的作用。

1673
01:16:40.000 --> 01:16:41.860
Well, I thought it was the perfect ending.
嗯，我觉得这是完美的结局。

1674
01:16:42.080 --> 01:16:50.920
