01:16:51.680 --> 01:16:52.120
Yeah.
是啊。

1676
01:16:52.280 --> 01:16:53.260
And in front of the cameras.
而且还是在摄像机镜头前。

1677
01:16:53.480 --> 01:16:53.920
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

1678
01:16:54.360 --> 01:16:59.300
I feel like the part, like once she got in her car, maybe it was a different story.
我觉得这部分吧，一旦她上了车，情况可能就完全不同了。

1679
01:16:59.940 --> 01:17:04.180
But she wasn't going to let them see too much.
但她不会让大家看到太多。

1680
01:17:04.560 --> 01:17:06.200
So the episode is wrapping up.
所以这一集就要接近尾声了。

1681
01:17:06.420 --> 01:17:07.880
We have Michael's talking head.
我们有迈克尔的单人访谈镜头。

1682
01:17:08.120 --> 01:17:13.120
And Jean and Lee said this was actually a series of three talking heads that they meshed together.
琼和李说这其实是一系列被他们剪辑到一起的三段单人访谈。

1683
01:17:13.440 --> 01:17:18.240
And then they had all this B-roll when he's like, he wished for Jan to get over him and
然后他们拍了所有这些B面花絮，当他说他希望简能忘了他，

1684
01:17:18.240 --> 01:17:25.100
Phyllis to get a plasma TV, for Pam to get courage and Angela to get a heart and Kelly to get a brain.
菲利丝能买到等离子电视，潘能鼓起勇气，安吉拉能有一颗心，凯利能有个大脑时。

1685
01:17:25.100 --> 01:17:27.600
And yeah, all of these moments.
还有是的，所有这些时刻。

1686
01:17:27.760 --> 01:17:29.000
I just loved it.
我太喜欢了。

1687
01:17:29.100 --> 01:17:31.380
I thought it was like such a great way to wrap up the episode.
我觉得这是为这一集收尾的绝佳方式。

1688
01:17:32.040 --> 01:17:35.800
And now, Jenna, let's discuss the tag.
现在，珍娜，我们来聊聊最后的彩蛋片段。

1689
01:17:36.700 --> 01:17:37.800
This is amazing.
这太棒了。

1690
