他有线索。

1695
01:17:54.720 --> 01:17:55.920
Dwight answers the phone.
德怀特接了电话。

1696
01:17:57.520 --> 01:18:04.380
And Kath noted in her blog that it took Rain six takes to get out the line, Dunder Mifflin slash Sex Predator hotline.
凯斯在她的博客里提到，雷恩拍了六次才把“邓德·米夫林斜杠性犯罪热线”这句话完整说出来。

1697
01:18:04.520 --> 01:18:05.260
This is Dwight Schrute.
我是德怀特·舒鲁特。

1698
