He had a really hard time saying it, like because it was making them laugh.
他真的很难把这句话说顺，因为这把大家都逗笑了。

1699
01:18:10.680 --> 01:18:15.940
And Jim tells Dwight that he saw the perp in the woman's bathroom above the sink.
吉姆告诉德怀特，他看到嫌犯在女洗手间的洗手池上方。

1700
01:18:15.940 --> 01:18:17.480
And this is Jim.
这就是吉姆。

1701
01:18:17.680 --> 01:18:23.320
This is Jim and Pam having a prank with each other without even knowing it.
这是吉姆和帕姆在甚至不知道的情况下互相恶作剧。

1702
01:18:23.480 --> 01:18:24.920
They're just missing each other.
他们只是错过了彼此。

1703
01:18:25.200 --> 01:18:26.840
Because Dwight runs in the bathroom.
